msgid "OpenLayers class library"
msgstr "OpenLayers类库"

msgid ""
"OpenLayers implements more comprehensive and complex front-end WebGIS "
"applications. This part introduces it."
msgstr "OpenLayers实现了更全面、更复杂的前端WebGIS应用程序。这一部分对其进行了介绍。"

msgid "Intruduction for OpenLayers"
msgstr "OpenLayers简介"

msgid "Intruduction for OpenLayers."
msgstr "OpenLayers简介。"

msgid ""
"Technical overview OpenLayers is a JavaScript package for developing WebGIS "
"clients. Sources supported by OpenLayers include Google Maps, Yahoo, Map, "
"Microsoft Virtual Earth, etc. Users can also use a simple image map as a "
"background image to overlay other layers in OpenLayers. In this regard, "
"OpenLayers provides a lot of s Choice."
msgstr ""
"技术概述OpenLayers是一个用于开发WebGIS客户端的JavaScript包。OpenLayers支持的来源包括谷歌地图、雅虎、地图、微软虚拟地球等。用户还可以使用简单的图像地图作为背景图像来覆盖OpenLayers中的其他层。在这方面，OpenLayers为S提供了很多选择。"

msgid ""
"The code implements the function of loading a tile map (ie OpenStreetMap "
"map) and can pan and zoom the map. When initializing a map, you need at "
"least one view, one or more layers, and a target HTML tag for the map to "
"load."
msgstr ""
"该代码实现了加载瓦片地图(即OpenStreetMap地图)的功能，并可以平移和缩放地图。在初始化地图时，您至少需要一个视图、一个或多个层以及一个目标HTML标记才能加载地图。"

msgid "The Second."
msgstr "第二个。"

msgid "`View the example <xx-ol-openstreet.html>`_"
msgstr "`View the example <xx-ol-openstreet.html>`_"

msgid "Map drag and zoom"
msgstr "地图拖动和缩放"

msgid ""
"The left mouse button can be used to drag the map, and the scroll wheel can "
"zoom the map. Shift + left mouse button to rotate the map."
msgstr "使用鼠标左键可以拖动地图，滚轮可以缩放地图。按住Shift键并使用鼠标左键旋转贴图。"

msgid "`View the example <xx-ol-dragrotate.html>`_"
msgstr "`View the example <xx-ol-dragrotate.html>`_"

msgid "ZoomToExtent Control"
msgstr "ZoomToExtent控件"

msgid ""
"This example demonstrates how to use the ``ol.control.ZoomToExtent`` "
"control. Click to go directly to the set  coordinate position."
msgstr "此示例演示如何使用  ``ol.control.ZoomToExtent`` 控制力。单击可直接转到设置的坐标位置。"

msgid "`View the example <xx-ol-zoomtoextent.html>`_"
msgstr "`View the example <xx-ol-zoomtoextent.html>`_"

msgid "ArcGIS REST MapService"
msgstr "ArcGIS REST地图服务"

msgid ""
"This example shows how to use ArcGIS REST MapService as a slice. This source"
" type supports maps and image services. For cached ArcGIS services, use "
"ol.source.XYZ for better performance."
msgstr ""
"此示例显示如何将ArcGIS REST "
"MapService用作切片。此源类型支持地图和影像服务。对于缓存的ArcGIS服务，请使用ol.Soure.XYZ以获得更好的性能。"

msgid "`View the example <xx-ol-arcgis.html>`_"
msgstr "`View the example <xx-ol-arcgis.html>`_"

msgid "Map drawing"
msgstr "地图绘制"

msgid ""
"An example of using ``ol.interaction.Draw`` interaction and "
"``ol.interaction.Modify`` interaction. You can paint on the   map. For "
"example, points, lines, polygons, etc."
msgstr ""
"使用的一个示例  ``ol.interaction.Draw`` 互动和  ``ol.interaction.Modify`` "
"互动。你可以在地图上画画。例如，点、线、多边形等。"

msgid "`View the example <xx-ol-draw.html>`_"
msgstr "`View the example <xx-ol-draw.html>`_"

msgid "Layer clipping"
msgstr "层剪裁"

msgid "Layer clip example. Display the map directly as a cut shape."
msgstr "层剪辑示例。将地图直接显示为切割形状。"

msgid "`View the example <xx-ol-precompose.html>`_"
msgstr "`View the example <xx-ol-precompose.html>`_"

msgid "Cartodb Map"
msgstr "CartoDB地图"

msgid "A simple case of Cartodb map."
msgstr "Cartodb映射的一个简单案例。"

msgid "`View the example <xx-ol-cartadb.html>`_"
msgstr "`View the example <xx-ol-cartadb.html>`_"

msgid "Map move animation"
msgstr "贴图移动动画"

msgid ""
"This example shows how to run one or more animations using the "
"``view.animate()`` method."
msgstr "此示例演示如何使用  ``view.animate()`` 方法。"

msgid "`View the example <xx-ol-animation.html>`_"
msgstr "`View the example <xx-ol-animation.html>`_"

msgid "WMS"
msgstr "WMS"

msgid ""
"A smooth reload of the presentation layer as the time dimension is "
"continuously changed. The data shows that the IEM generated a NUS NEXRAD "
"WSR-88D grade III alkali reflectance CONUS complex."
msgstr "随着时间维度的连续变化，流畅地重新加载表示层。数据表明，IEM产生了NUS NEXRAD WSR-88D III级碱反射CONUS复合体。"

msgid "`View the example <xx-ol-wms-webgispub.html>`_"
msgstr "`View the example <xx-ol-wms-webgispub.html>`_"

msgid "Map modification feature"
msgstr "地图修改功能"

msgid ""
"This example shows how to use extent extens to draw a modifiable range."
msgstr "此示例说明如何使用范围扩展来绘制可修改的范围。"

msgid "`View the example <xx-ol-modify-features.html>`_"
msgstr "`View the example <xx-ol-modify-features.html>`_"

msgid "Control Color"
msgstr "控制颜色"

msgid ""
"The raster source allows arbitrary manipulation of pixel values. In this "
"example, the RGB values on the input tile source are adjusted in pixel mode "
"before being rendered using the second raster source. The raster operation "
"converts the pixels in the RGB space into HCL color spaces, adjusts the "
"values according to the above controls, and then converts them back into RGB"
" space for rendering."
msgstr ""
"栅格源允许任意操作像素值。在本例中，输入平铺源上的RGB值在使用第二个栅格源渲染之前以像素模式进行调整。栅格操作将RGB空间中的像素转换为HCL颜色空间，根据上述控件调整值，然后将它们转换回RGB空间进行渲染。"

msgid "`View the example <xx-ol-color.html>`_"
msgstr "`View the example <xx-ol-color.html>`_"

msgid "CanvasPattern"
msgstr "CanvasPattern"

msgid ""
"First, this example creates a reusable CanvasPattern and a CanvasGradient. "
"These countries are loaded from the GeoJSON file. The style function "
"determines whether each country is populated with a pre-generated "
"CanvasGradient or CanvasPattern."
msgstr ""
"首先，本例创建了一个可重复使用的CanvesPattern和一个CanvesGRadient。这些国家/地区是从GeoJSON文件加载的。Style函数确定每个国家/地区是使用预先生成的CanvesGRadient填充还是使用CanvesPattern填充。"

msgid "`View the example <xx-ol-canvaspattern.html>`_"
msgstr "`View the example <xx-ol-canvaspattern.html>`_"

msgid "Export"
msgstr "出口"

msgid ""
"Export a map as an example of a PNG image. This example requires a browser "
"that supports canvas.toBlob()."
msgstr "以PNG图像为例导出地图。本例需要支持canvar.toBlob()的浏览器。"

msgid "`View the example <xx-ol-export.html>`_"
msgstr "`View the example <xx-ol-export.html>`_"

msgid "XYZ Esri"
msgstr "XYZ ESRI"

msgid "``ol.source.XYZ`` supports ArcGIS REST tiles services."
msgstr "``ol.source.XYZ`` 支持ArcGIS REST磁贴服务。"

msgid "`View the example <xx-ol-XYZ.html>`_"
msgstr "`View the example <xx-ol-XYZ.html>`_"

msgid "Mouse position"
msgstr "鼠标位置"

msgid ""
"An example of mouse position control outside the map. Display the "
"coordinates of the mouse in real time."
msgstr "地图外部鼠标位置控制的一个示例。实时显示鼠标的坐标。"

msgid "`View the example <xx-ol-mouse.html>`_"
msgstr "`View the example <xx-ol-mouse.html>`_"

msgid "Constrained scaling"
msgstr "有约束的缩放"

msgid ""
"The view of this map is limited to zoom levels 9 and 13. This can be done "
"using the minZoom and maxZoom view options."
msgstr "此地图的视图被限制为缩放级别9和13。这可以使用minZoom和MaxZoom视图选项来实现。"

msgid "`View the example <xx-ol-constrained.html>`_"
msgstr "`View the example <xx-ol-constrained.html>`_"
